depth-pressure-build-question = Into a beaker of { $name } (12 cm of it) we lower a funnel covered with a rubber film; a tube leads from it to a U-tube manometer with water. We write down how far apart the water levels in the manometer are with the film 3, 6 and 9 cm deep, and at last turn it sideways at 9 cm. How does the liquid’s pressure depend on the depth?
depth-pressure-setup = A 1 L beaker of liquid, a funnel with a rubber film on a tube, a liquid (U-tube) manometer with water, a ruler
